#. Description of the plugin
#: pdf-forms-for-contact-form-7.php:5
msgid "Build Contact Form 7 forms from PDF forms. Get PDFs auto-filled and attached to email messages and/or website responses on form submission."
msgstr "Erstelle Contact-Form-7-Formulare aus PDF-Formularen. Lass PDFs beim Absenden des Formulars automatisch ausfüllen und an E-Mail-Nachrichten und/oder Website-Antworten anhängen."

